<h1 class="title">Inline markup corner cases</h1>

<p><em>a</em> <strong>b</strong> <span class="docutils literal">c</span> <cite>d</cite> <em>E</em> text <a href="#system-message-4"><span class="problematic" id="problematic-6">f_</span></a> <a href="#system-message-3"><span class="problematic" id="problematic-3">g__</span></a> <a class="brackets" href="#footnote-1" id="footnote-reference-1" role="doc-noteref"><span class="fn-bracket">[</span>1<span class="fn-bracket">]</span></a> <a class="brackets" href="#footnote-4" id="footnote-reference-2" role="doc-noteref"><span class="fn-bracket">[</span>4<span class="fn-bracket">]</span></a> <a class="brackets" href="#footnote-5" id="footnote-reference-3" role="doc-noteref"><span class="fn-bracket">[</span>*<span class="fn-bracket">]</span></a> <a href="#system-message-5"><span class="problematic" id="citation-reference-1">[x]_</span></a> <span class="target" id="h">h</span></p>
<p>&quot;<em>quoted</em>&quot; '<em>quoted</em>' (<em>paren</em>) [<em>bracket</em>] {<em>brace</em>} &lt;<em>angle</em>&gt;
<em>not emphasis * and * not either</em>, 2*3*4, a*b, <em>a*b, a*b</em>c.</p>
<p><strong>strong**text and text**strong</strong>, <span class="docutils literal"><span class="pre">lit``eral,</span> <span class="pre">x``lit</span></span>.</p>
<p>Escapes: *not emphasis*, \backslash, `not interpreted`, ab, C:\dir.</p>
<p><a class="reference external" href="http://phrase.example.org">phrase reference</a>, <a class="reference external" href="http://example.org/ab">phrase</a>, <a class="reference external" href="http://bare.example.org">http://bare.example.org</a>,
<a class="reference external" href="http://phrase.example.org">alias</a>, <a class="reference external" href="http://x.org">anon embedded</a>, <a class="reference external" href="http://esc.example.org">with &lt;escaped&gt;</a>.</p>
<p><em>role</em>, <strong>suffix role</strong>, <span class="docutils literal">lit\eral</span>, <code>x = 1</code>,
<tt class="math">a^2</tt>, <a class="reference external" href="https://peps.python.org/pep-0008">PEP 8</a>, <a class="reference external" href="https://peps.python.org/pep-0287">PEP 287</a>, <a class="reference external" href="https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2822.html">RFC 2822</a>, <a class="reference external" href="https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2822.html#section-3">RFC 2822</a>, <cite>T</cite>,
<abbr>abbr</abbr>, <abbr>ACR</abbr>, <sub>s</sub>, <sup>s</sup>, <a href="#system-message-1"><span class="problematic" id="problematic-1">:pep:`x`</span></a>, <a href="#system-message-2"><span class="problematic" id="problematic-2">:rfc:`0`</span></a>.</p>
