<p>URIs: <a class="reference external" href="http://www.example.org">http://www.example.org</a>, &lt;<a class="reference external" href="http://example.org/path">http://example.org/path</a>&gt;, (<a class="reference external" href="https://example.org/">https://example.org/</a>),
<a class="reference external" href="ftp://ftp.example.org/file.txt">ftp://ftp.example.org/file.txt</a>; <a class="reference external" href="news:comp.lang.python">news:comp.lang.python</a>, <a class="reference external" href="urn:isbn:0-486-27557-4">urn:isbn:0-486-27557-4</a>,
<a class="reference external" href="http://example.org/a_(b">http://example.org/a_(b</a>), <a class="reference external" href="http://example.org/x">http://example.org/x</a>., foo:bar, user&#64;example.org,
mailto:user&#64;example.org?subject=hi, http://example.org/*escaped, www.example.org.</p>
<p>Footnote refs: text <a class="brackets" href="#footnote-1" id="footnote-reference-4" role="doc-noteref"><span class="fn-bracket">[</span>1<span class="fn-bracket">]</span></a> and[2]_ and <a class="brackets" href="#footnote-3" id="footnote-reference-5" role="doc-noteref"><span class="fn-bracket">[</span>3<span class="fn-bracket">]</span></a>.</p>
